namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIDragDropSubsystem {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIDragDrop.h#DreamUIDragDropSubsystem
    src   "The drag VISUAL: when a drag carrying an operation with a DragVisualClass begins, this spawns\nthat widget on a raycast-disabled overlay canvas and walks it under the pointer until the drag\nends. Purely cosmetic -- sources and targets work without it -- which is why it lives in a\nsubsystem rather than in the pipeline."
    text  "拖动视觉表现：当携带带有 DragVisualClass 的操作的拖动开始时，此对象会在禁用射线检测的覆盖画布上生成\n该控件，并让它在指针下移动，直到拖动\n结束。纯属视觉表现——源和目标无需它也能工作——因此它位于\n子系统而不是管线中。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDragDropSubsystem:CancelActiveDrag {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIDragDrop.h#DreamUIDragDropSubsystem:CancelActiveDrag
    src   "Cancel every drag in flight, every player's: each source is told its drag ended, unhandled operations get\ntheir OnDragCancelled, and the visuals go away.\n@return true when there was at least one drag to cancel."
    text  "取消所有进行中的拖动，包括每个玩家的拖动：每个源都会收到其拖动已结束的通知，未处理的操作会触发\n其 OnDragCancelled，视觉表现也随之消失。\n@return 当至少有一个可取消的拖动时返回 true。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDragDropSubsystem:CancelActiveDragForUser {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIDragDrop.h#DreamUIDragDropSubsystem:CancelActiveDragForUser
    src   "Cancel player InUserIndex's drags, and only theirs: what Escape does during a drag. Any player's Escape used to\ncancel player 0's drag.\n@return true when that player had a drag to cancel."
    text  "取消玩家 InUserIndex 的拖动，且仅限该玩家的：即拖动期间按 Escape 所做的事。以前任何玩家按 Escape 都会\n取消玩家 0 的拖动。\n@return 当该玩家有可取消的拖动时返回 true。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDragDropSubsystem:GetDragCount {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIDragDrop.h#DreamUIDragDropSubsystem:GetDragCount
    src   "How many drags are being followed at once. One per finger on a touch screen, per player."
    text  "正在跟踪的拖拽数量。每个触摸屏上的手指对应一个拖拽，每个玩家对应一个拖拽。"
    state machine
}

