DreamUIDragSource {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIDragDrop.h#DreamUIDragSource
    src   "Makes its widget a drag SOURCE with meaning: when the pointer pipeline starts a drag here, this\ncreates a UDreamDragDropOperation and writes it onto the pointer's event data, where drop targets\nfind it. Without one of these (or code doing the same), a drag is pure geometry -- which is\nexactly what a scroll view wants and an inventory item does not.\n\nFill the properties for the common case, or override CreateDragOperation for a payload only\nruntime knows. Returning null from the override declines the meaning without disturbing the\ngeometric drag."
    text  "使其控件成为有含义的拖动源：当指针管线在此处开始拖动时，此对象会\n创建一个 UDreamDragDropOperation 并将其写入指针的事件数据，放置目标\n从中查找它。若没有此组件（或执行相同操作的代码），拖动就只是纯几何行为——这正是\n滚动视图想要的，而物品栏物品则不然。\n\n常见情况下填写属性，或为只有运行时才知道的载荷重写 CreateDragOperation。\n从重写中返回 null 会拒绝该含义，但不会影响\n几何拖动。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDragSource:bAllowEventBubbleUp {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIDragDrop.h#DreamUIDragSource:bAllowEventBubbleUp
    src   "Whether the drag events keep bubbling above this widget while an operation rides them.\nDefault off: an item inside a scroll view should be DRAGGED, not scroll its list."
    text  "在操作随拖动事件传递期间，拖动事件是否继续冒泡到此控件之上。\n默认关闭：滚动视图中的物品应当被拖动，而不是滚动其列表。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIDragSource:CreateDragOperation {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIDragDrop.h#DreamUIDragSource:CreateDragOperation
    src   "Build the operation for a drag that just started here. The default fills it from the properties."
    text  "为刚刚在此处开始的拖动构建操作。默认实现会从属性中填充它。"
